s <b>Toqabaqita, Toʼambaita, Malu</b> and <b>Maluʼu</b>, is a language spoken by the people living at the north-western tip of Malaita Island, of South Eastern Solomon Islands. Toʼabaita is an Austronesian language.</p>"}